
  Setting up Field Notes                              0:00

  ⣽ Write the site files
    Setup writes your site into
    /home/sam/sites/field-notes on this computer.
  ○ Set up the database, storage bucket, and email
  ○ Commit the site
  ○ Store the deploy key in GitHub
  ○ Push the site to GitHub
  ○ Run the first deploy
  ○ Connect fieldnotes.example.com
  ○ Sign in to the admin

  You can leave this running. When your site is live,
  setup emails a sign-in link to sam@example.com.

